      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "景致小姐那纯洁而美丽的精神世界，\n无论谁都会被其吸引，无法不去深爱着她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07c40ad248b576f5b48b2e2dccecaf949e868508cb5b618706cede2255f0d586",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
