      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "甚至连这个世界也在深爱着她，\n给予她光芒、献上祝福……――\n没错，那甚至是连我，都会为之动容的程度！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05aee5efd98b6255868512025a4e2b3bd693a721f2e9b3680f12ec27687107e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
