      "uid": "zhcn:aa1c0a53919e98d3c7f4eefe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看着宛如赞美般、\n正慷慨激昂高谈阔论的红色梦想，\n心中闪过了一丝不安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39ab34e9274a82bc36403e7d5da85caa9525614cb29fdf4566c903cbcf3914bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
