    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3d7534a74ac587302aeae30",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对于同样要在『异世界』里闪耀的\n我而言，她毫无疑问，是必须要跨越的存在\n――也就是最大的考验……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a125a6b4c4af69bfdbf9fc6be23e1e8c5a7a171d422639c08a2e7ca4f0602c77",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
