    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6f5201e964cbf9b7c9db489",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为我，只有在“彼方之地”\n才能展现出真正闪耀的身姿。\n我应当抵达的终点，在遥远的彼岸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa014f73aae9bb1939278b7c6d64f9e38cf56be564bcdd3c982e18a2a2448e4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        75,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/75/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:157c883fcd7ab6e59a3f5bb0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对那强有力的论述、以及炽热的眼神，\n不由得感到心悦诚服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f424568975a9a85f9f934c47ca141324c66685ee7566c8d4bd0817b9c484df8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        76,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/76/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4f6d6368767151fa4ef94d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你并没有失去自信，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "36c47d0b55299266dbd329e9b4003d8752a781056a26f08d6b0545216478e33b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        77,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/77/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e278cc95917cd656c8e4f505",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你并没有失去自信，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "36c47d0b55299266dbd329e9b4003d8752a781056a26f08d6b0545216478e33b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136113.json",
      "json_path": [
